Top-down dungeon map, dark fantasy style, ink and parchment aesthetic. A castle courtyard at night, seen from above. Stone walls surround a cobblestone yard. In the north corner, a circular stone well with a wooden frame and a frayed rope hanging into darkness. Moonlight casts long shadows. A single torch on the wall near the well. Ivy climbing the walls. Puddles of rainwater on the cobblestones. Grid overlay 5ft squares. No text, no labels. Muted palette: grays, dark blues, warm torch orange.
